{
  "id": "JHN.17",
  "number": "17",
  "bookId": "JHN",
  "reference": "Yohana 17",
  "verseCount": 26,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "17",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Yesu yamazire kugamba ebigambo ebyo, yainunura amaisho yaleba omw'iguru, yagamba ati, “Tata, esaa yagoba. Singa okuze Omwana wawe, n'Omwana wawe ogwo akuhe ekitinwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'okuba omutungire obushobora aha bantu bona, abo wamutungire bona abahe oburora obutalihwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara oburora obutalihwaho nibw'obu: Bakumanye iwe Ruhanga omumoi ow'amazima, bamanye na Yesu Kirisito owo watumire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu nsi nkuhaire ekitinwa, orwo ngobesheleize omulimo ogwo wampaire kukora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu Tata singa onkuze omu businge bwawe, ontunge ekitinwa ekyo nanye naiwe twabaire twinakyo ensi etakatonzirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abantu abo waronkire omu nsi okabantunga, mbakumanyisize. Bakaba baawe, iwe wabantunga, mara n'ekigambo kyawe bakyekomize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu bamanyiire okwo buli kantu ako wantungire nikaruga ahali iwe; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "enshonga mbagambire ebigambo ebyo iwe wangambire, mara babitoire, bamanya n'okwo gali mazima okwo narugire ahali iwe, baikiliize okwo wantumire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninshabira bonene; tindikushabira nsi, shana abo wantungire, enshonga bawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abange bona bawe, n'abawe bange, mara ekitinwa kyange nikimanyikira omuli bonene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu inye tinkili mu nsi, kyonkai bonene bali omu nsi, kandi inye ninyija ahali iwe. Tata Omutakatifu, singa obagumise omw'ibara lyawe elyo wantungire babone kuba bamoi okwo inye na iwe tuli bamoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo mbaire nkyainabo mbagumisize omw'ibara lyawe. Mbalinzire, taliho alikuburaho n'omoi shana omuraamwa wenkai, kugobesheleza Ebihandiko Bitakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonkai mbwenu ninyija ahali iwe. Kandi ebigambo ebi nimbigambira omu nsi, ebyera byange bishobore kubaijura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekigambo kyawe nkibahaire, kandi ensi nebanoba aha rw'okuba bonene tibayo, okwo nangu nanye ntali wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tindikubashabira k'obaihya mu nsi. Nimbashabira k'obahungya aha Mubisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonene ti ba nsi, okwo nanye ntali wayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Singa obahindure batakatifu nibajunwa amazima; ekigambo kyawe gaba mazima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'okwo wantumire omu nsi, kutyo nanye mbatumire omu nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninkwehongera aha bwa bonene, na bonene babone kukwehongera omu mazima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tindikubashabira bonkai, ninshabira na bona abalikwikiliza ebyo aba balikubagambira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bona babe omoi. Mara okwo iwe Tata osingiire omuli inye, nanye ndi omuli iwe, na bonene babone kuba omuli ichwe, ensi eshobore kwikiliza okwo wantumire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitinwa eky'ontungire nikyo mbahaire, bashobore kuba omoi okwo ichwe tuli omoi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "inye ndi omuli bonene, na iwe osingiire omuli inye, bonene kuba omoi emalimali, ensi eije emanye okwo wantumire n'okwo wangondize okagonza na bonene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tata, ningonza n'abo wantungire tube hamoi mbali ndi, babone ekitinwa kyange ekyo wangondize okantunga ensi ethakabaireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tata omugorogoki, ensi tekakumanyaga, kyonkai inye ninkumanya; mara n'aba nibamanya okwo wantumire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbakumanyisize, mara ndashuba mbakumanyise, engonzi ezo wangondize zibone kusingira omuli bonene, nanye mbe omuli bonene.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
